    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2>Hello, Cave Monster! is a tactical RPG about conflict resolution. Convince anxious cave creatures that you are intelligent, and they might stop murdering you. Ride a Drillship as deep as you can, until it breaks. Lead an oddball team of bureaucrats and scientists through underground darkness, as they search for exotic knowledge and sensible negotiating partners. <br><br><br><strong>Research the locals and figure out how to understand them</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085580/extras/b3915ca349d76367158d3589dba627cf.poster.avif?t=1730925695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085580/extras/b3915ca349d76367158d3589dba627cf.webm?t=1730925695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085580/extras/b3915ca349d76367158d3589dba627cf.mp4?t=1730925695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Explore strange new procedurally-generated dungeons and boldly interact with their contents. </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085580/extras/0414d93e8c70215f56148016e247c630.poster.avif?t=1730925695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085580/extras/0414d93e8c70215f56148016e247c630.webm?t=1730925695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085580/extras/0414d93e8c70215f56148016e247c630.mp4?t=1730925695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Engage in turn-based tactical encounters to communicate your benign intent. </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a